                ],
                "description": "What display surface this variant is prepared for. 'duplicate-copy' means a bit-identical or near-identical second copy (e.g., '(1)' suffix) with no obvious surface specialization. 'partial-crop' means one of SEVERAL complementary crops of a work too wide or tall for any single panel — each preserves different elements and none is redundant with the others; pair it with crop_position."
